."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is just over 180cm tall, has a large frame, and is naturally muscular. Having grown up exposed to violence, he consciously trains his body for self-defense."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While riding his motorcycle home, he gets into a car accident and suffers serious injuries. He breaks both arms and one leg and is at a loss when he is helped by Yoshino, the man responsible for the accident, and he begins to open up to him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c149033"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e1012ffef326d72d75dc23a1a4922ec2036d95bb80f981488f436bcab03e1cf8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c00a80b70609e0ce32c2488072555b44bdce90f687d871e99da7535db2a48c5b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"摩利凸男","creatorId":"vndb:s47712","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s47712","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s47712","name":"摩利凸男","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99738","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c149035","characterName":"芳野 啓史","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c149035"},"originalCharacterName":"芳野 啓史","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"31"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1102"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"72"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A man in his 30s with a worn-out appearance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He 